<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><font face="arial">We received a notice from the bank that the payment from&nbsp;{!Case.Date_of_Bounce__c}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;was returned non-sufficient funds. Please let me know if there are funds in the account to rerun the payment.&nbsp;</span></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><p class="MsoNormal" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">National Funding, Inc.,&nbsp;the parent and servicing&nbsp;company of&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Quick Bridge Funding, LLC</span></b></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: medium;">9820 Towne Centre Drive</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">San Diego, CA 92121</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div>]]></td>
